{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SRA Project</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a thrilling journey with a game designed to challenge, entertain, and keep you on your toes. If you\u2019re looking for a difficult yet rewarding experience, one that requires learning and constant improvement, then this game is for you. It\u2019s perfect for those who want to take the path of self-betterment and mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >S.R.A Project is a roguelike, bullet hell, wave survival game where you face relentless attacks from cosmic creatures. Adapt and evolve alongside these challenges. Prove your worth by defeating the leader and earn the right to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share your screenshots of the main menu to join our leaderboard, or play solo to master the game on your own terms. We appreciate any reports of bugs you may stumble with or any suggestions for developing abilities and improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD - Move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow Keys - Shoot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc - Pause</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift - Dash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold R - Restart</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space - Active</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3799290/5785fdd692f52a6d131f7682c198faecaaf31e94.jpg"},{"name":"First Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3799290/5785fdd692f52a6d131f7682c198faecaaf31e94.jpg"},{"name":"Beginner No More","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3799290/5785fdd692f52a6d131f7682c198faecaaf31e94.jpg"},{"name":"Sailor Down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3799290/5785fdd692f52a6d131f7682c198faecaaf31e94.jpg"},{"name":"Crystal Code","path":"https:/